	(text "RFVD-EXP v1.1 design values (2026-10-04)\nU1502 TPS259631 (TI SLVSET8A):\n ILIM Eq.5 RILM = 903/(ILIM - 0.0112)\n   R1513 1.50k -> 0.613 A (DDS shield 2.14 W)\n OVLO Eq.2 VOV = 1.2 V x (R1509+R1512)/R1512\n   470k/64.9k -> 9.89 V (9.43-10.28 V wc)\n dVdt Eq.4 CdVdt = 42000 pF / SR\n   47 nF -> 0.89 V/ms, 51 mA into 57 uF\nU1501 TPS2553 (TI SLVS841F Eq.1):\n   R1503 45.3k -> IOS 524 / 577 / 638 mA\nJ1201 on B.Cu (mirrored), 5.0 mm stack,\n pin 36 reserved NC, SH pads = GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.495 178.435 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "210216f4-0e6d-47cd-954c-e7826e1bb505")
	)
	(text "U1501 switches +3V3_D onto the shield's 3.3 V pins; EXP_3V3_EN from the MCU, fault on EXP_FAULT_N (R1501 pull-up).\nU1502 feeds EXP_VHP from VSYS with adjustable OVLO and auto-retry; EXP_VHP_EN from the MCU, R1511 holds it off at reset.\nR1505/R1507 and R1506/R1508 scale EXP_VHP and +3V3_EXP for the MCU ADC (EXP_VHP_SNS, EXP_3V3_SNS)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.055 133.985 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38094433-d2b6-491d-9e24-4430fb6aecc8")
	)
	(text "+3V3_EXP SWITCH: U1501 TPS2553D (R1503 45.3k sets 524 / 577 / 638 mA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37.846 29.972 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45012e17-a8ca-4931-a443-3ce0e11b75ee")
	)
	(text "RAIL READBACK DIVIDERS TO THE MCU ADC"
